# Next.js + DatoCMS (next-dato)

Complements [`react-rsc.mdc`](react-rsc.mdc) and [`datocms-blocks.mdc`](datocms-blocks.mdc). Do not fetch GraphQL from Client Components.

## RSC + GraphQL

- CDA only via [`datocmsFetch`](../../src/infra/datocms/client.ts) from Server Components, route handlers, or Server Actions (`src/infra/datocms/get-*.ts`).
- `includeDrafts: true` only when `draftMode().isEnabled`; published fetches use `DATOCMS_API_TOKEN`.
- Never import `infra/` into `"use client"` files.

## Cache tags + on-demand revalidation

`datocmsFetch` already sets `next.tags` (ignored in draft / `no-store`). Keep tags in sync with the query:

| Fetch | Tags (examples) |
|-------|-----------------|
| `get-page` | `datocms:page`, `page:${locale}:${slug}` |
| `get-blog` | `datocms:blog`, `datocms:posts`, `post:…` |
| `get-navigation` | `NAV_TAG`, `navigation:${locale}` |
| `get-site-seo` | `datocms:site-seo`, `site-seo:${locale}` |
| sitemap / search / home | existing `SITEMAP_TAG` / `SEARCH_TAG` / `datocms:site` |

A DatoCMS webhook should call `revalidateTag` for those same strings (no route in this repo yet). Do not invent tags that fetches never set. Time-based `revalidate` remains the fallback.

## Codegen

After any change to `*.graphql` or [`queries.ts`](../../src/infra/datocms/queries.ts):

1. Update **both** `queries.ts` and `page-by-slug.graphql` (and fragment files).
2. Run `npm run codegen`.
3. Commit generated files; never hand-edit `src/infra/datocms/generated/**`.

`codegen:check` runs on CI and `.husky/pre-push`.

## Images

Use [`DatoResponsivePicture`](../../src/components/patterns/dato-responsive-picture.tsx) + [`datocms-image-loader.ts`](../../src/lib/datocms-image-loader.ts) (`next/image`). Do **not** use `react-datocms` `<Image />` or raw `<img>` (CSP, `<picture>` mobile/desktop, loader).

New or updated image fields: add `blurUpThumb` to the GraphQL fragment and pass `placeholder="blur"` + `blurDataURL` on `next/image`. `priority` / `fetchPriority="high"` only for LCP.

## Anti-patterns

- Dato fetch in client components
- `includeDrafts: true` on public pages by default
- Hand-editing `generated/**`
- `revalidateTag` for tags the fetch never declared
- `react-datocms` Image / new `<img>` instead of `DatoResponsivePicture`
